job('@Riff','riff_c02','Input image is the Riff sheet edit target. Preserve EXACT face, ginger fur, muzzle, freckles, ears, forelock, stocky body, tail, waistcoat, green trousers, gloves and shoes. Change ivory inner-shirt collar to two small symmetrical tips lying FLAT and TUCKED UNDER waistcoat neckline, stable continuous collar seam. Add a small unobtrusive brown leather ray-pistol holster to anatomical RIGHT hip, with just brass grip visible. Preserve three horizontal panels: front collar-to-shoes WITHOUT head, back collar-to-shoes WITHOUT head, only head portrait on right. No loose collar flaps, hats, labels, new identities, extra heads or detached limbs.', ['assets/asset_riff/riff_c01.png'])
job('@Guard','guard_c02','Input guard sheet is edit target. Preserve exactly hound identity, mustache, cap, navy tunic/brass buttons, tan trousers, gloves and muddy zigzag-tread boots. Front body panel: BOTH feet planted with both toes facing camera/forward in natural matching alignment. Back body panel: BOTH feet planted and toes naturally facing away with the body; remove lifted backward-facing sole pose. No twisted ankles, no one forward/one reversed foot. Preserve horizontal three-panel sheet: front headless wardrobe, back headless wardrobe, one detailed head portrait at right. Same costume and body size, no labels.', ['assets/asset_guard/guard_c01.png'])
job('@Driver','driver_c01','Create ONE original gray badger delivery driver, plainly distinct from otter brothers and hound guard: gray fur, white muzzle stripe, brown flat cap, beige work shirt, dark gray waistcoat, charcoal trousers, dark work shoes, cream gloves. Average build and friendly distracted working face. Horizontal 16:9 sheet: left front collar-to-shoes wardrobe WITHOUT head, middle back wardrobe WITHOUT head, right the ONLY head portrait with badger stripe and cap. Exactly one head, no labels or text. He will be 1H standing and seated in the truck cab.', [])
job('@Blaster','blaster_c01','Create a clear hero view of ONE compact original brass-and-black 1930s cartoon science-fiction ray pistol, short barrel with visible circular muzzle, dark wooden curved grip, visible trigger and trigger guard, a small copper coil detail. Seamless cream studio background, horizontal 16:9. It is an actual handheld prop, 0.3H long, visually fits Riffs glove and small right-hip holster. No hands, characters, brands, writing, bullets, realistic weapon diagrams or extra objects. Readable silhouette and simple cel shading.', [])
job('@Clock','clock_c01','Create ONE antique bronze-rim wall clock on a seamless neutral cream background, horizontal 16:9. Ivory dial with EXACTLY twelve short dark tick marks, dark long minute hand at eleven tick and short hour hand just before twelve tick (11:55). NO Arabic numbers, NO Roman numerals, NO digital inset, NO writing anywhere. Circular dial, ordinary compact wall-clock shape, two hands individually visible on one axle, no second hand. Keep hands nearly still by design. No characters or other objects.', [])
job('@Museum','museum_c03','Input museum plate is edit target. Preserve architecture, lighting, storm, open empty central display case, doorway, tiles and zigzag muddy prints. Change only upper-right wall clock: SMALL normal wall fixture with diameter about one third an adult-character height, no giant foreground clock. Same bronze rim, ivory face, twelve short tick marks, two hands set to 11:55. Remove ALL Arabic/Roman numerals and digital/written numbers. Clock remains mounted at exactly its current wall position. No people, silhouettes, diamond, featured props or feather trail. Horizontal wide plate.', ['assets/asset_museum/museum_c02.png'])
job('@Alley','alley_c02','Input rainy alley plate is edit target. Preserve brick walls, street direction, wet cobbles, lamps and distant tower. Replace green dumpster along left wall with consistent symmetrical TWO-LID design: equal left and right hinged metal lids, visible central split and permanent hinges, BOTH lids open equally about 55 degrees; both stay attached. Dumpster height 0.9H and width 2H. No loose cover, no missing half, no people, NO FEATHERS anywhere. Distant clock face has tick marks only, no numerals. Wide empty establishing plate, painted style unchanged.', ['assets/asset_alley/alley_c01.png'])
job('@Tower','tower_c02','Input 1 is supplied screenshot WORLD-LAYOUT source; input 2 is prior empty tower edit target. Make a wide EMPTY fixed stage plate preserving screenshot architecture: tall left arched city window, permanent rope attached to left-center overhead beam, closed trapdoor below/near rope, exposed rear-center clock gears, burgundy curtain far right. Extend ceiling/side margins to accommodate a future 4H full-body Crow without moving world anchors. No numerical markings on clockwork/dial. Add one FIXED small brass-and-teal controller in recess behind partly open right curtain. Add stationary RED electrical cable visibly clamped flat to floor: route from right-side Crow-foot location to right controller; it never connects to people or moves. Machine placement region stays rear-center matching screenshot, but remove all people, Crow, Golden Diamond and featured main machine from this empty environment plate. Hoist rope already present, its lower grip loop within a 1H actors shoulder reach beside trapdoor. Single continuous scene, no panels, labels or diagrams.', [source,'assets/asset_tower/tower_c01.png'])
job('@Truck','truck_c02','Input truck hero plate is edit target. Preserve cream/red rounded 1930s design, grille, fenders, four-wheel chassis and wooden cargo deck. Give it LARGE plausible vehicle proportions: cab height 2H, vehicle length 5H, cab comfortably fits one 1H seated adult. Open rear cargo deck long enough for two 1H adults side-by-side, fixed low wooden safety rail, a few ordinary crates placed rearward leaving actor space. Cab and cargo deck clearly distinct; steering wheel and bench seat entirely inside cab. Single vehicle on neutral cream backdrop in side three-quarter view, no visible driver/people in this prop sheet, no labels or text. Vehicle must not look toy-sized relative to characters.', ['assets/asset_truck/truck_c01.png'])

